Search Name: NSA Rule Troubleshooting - Prof-GA-E-U-SE - Related activity and parser 
Search Description: Given a specific rule_id, extract the fields of the events that contributed to the specific detections. 
Timeframe: 24 hours

Search:  
SELECT RGX_EXTRACT("src_activity_type\":\"(.+?)\"") as associated_activity_type, RGX_EXTRACT("msg_type\":\"(.+?)\"") as event_msg_type,
count(*) as tcount 
WHERE rule_id:"Prof-GA-E-U-SE"  
GROUP-BY associated_activity_type, event_msg_type ORDER-BY tcount DESC
